# Deploy only the static site. Project Root Directory is `website/`, but the
# CLI still uploads from the repo root — without this, Vercel tries to ship the
# whole monorepo (target/, node_modules/, old installers) and either hits the
# 15k-file cap or uploads multi-GB archives.
*
!website
!website/**

# Keep historical fat installers off the CDN; ship only stable + current.
website/downloads/*.exe
!website/downloads/MaxSpeech_x64-setup.exe
!website/downloads/MaxSpeech_0.5.1-beta_x64-setup.exe
